{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 41","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula expressing the relationship between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in the table is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a58f83b5a41d890678d7b79e2498967c3a40ec5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline x &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 &amp; 5 &amp; 6\\\\ \\hline y &amp; 0 &amp; 2 &amp; 6 &amp; 12 &amp; 20\\\\ \\hline\\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b41d70bd86688f48c6a18aa56a109fddc4d5cfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y = 2x-4\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ y = x^{2}-3x+2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ y = x^{3}-3x^{2}+2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"520\" height=\"19\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/593e56d627ea60308ac3f75dd8bd00847dfc4c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ y = x^{2}-4x\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ y = x^{2}-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"277\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just plug the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b6400c6fe3f1ed70e5afd387a9686cdc3fa09531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19d4fd572d75d6f9e0b13bd416e2ede37623b9e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6,20)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> into each of the 5 answer choices:\n</p><p>(A): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b3db623585c9f24339294a2975d48d2432ab6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(6)-4=8\\ne20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>(B): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aacf1e94dc7d2c5db31276e60287ec9808077ded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2-3(6)+2=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>(C): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5feeaebe58f9070ecd1dcf62a35e3231ca7edc18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^3-3(6^2)+2(6)=120\\ne20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>(D): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/916e98271142627277dbf5e54ac3835f22dca514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2-4(6)=12\\ne20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>(E): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f21361fde91c4a18dc3a45b5e22289f4ce5116c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2-4=32\\ne20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>The only one that works is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">Problem 42</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_